    • Whether RCMP's NC3 unit should be involved                                                              
    • Whether other people in your community are seeing the same symptoms and could share information         
                                                                                                              
    Some of those are protective, some are investigative. None of them are required. But knowing they exist   
    might matter later.                                                                                       
                                                                                                              
    Practical next step                                                                                       
                                                                                                              
    Right now, can you check the high school laptop's BIOS version and see if a password is set? If it        
