    the laptop, not your phone, for the setup)                                                                
    3. Send yourself the work files from any source that has them — your email if you have backups, your      
    client if they have copies, recreate from memory/notes/screenshots if you have to                         
    4. Deliver to your client via that fresh email or whatever secure channel they use                        
                                                                                                              
